This repository is a collection of skill payloads copied from other projects.
No single license covers the upstream code.

Each directory under skills/ keeps the license and copyright notice of its
upstream. Read skills/<namespace>/LICENSE before you use or redistribute that
namespace. The anthropics namespace also keeps a LICENSE.txt inside each skill
directory, and skills/anthropics/NOTICE records the copy. The aaron-he-zhu
namespace is Apache License 2.0; skills/aaron-he-zhu/NOTICE records the copy.

The README and this file explain the collection. They do not relicense the
files under skills/.
